{"c":[{"id":"09440533b9d582ef","sum":"fold_request quotes captions only; ids on Run: and wake. Membership is this repo, not this clone; skip PR opened, checks passed, task archived. Write rule is editable init/AGENTS.md; Usage owns argv. Wording unpinned except AGENTS.md lockstep. Leaves: leafset_id, leaf_digests.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"7bdadb9eac2d17e2","sum":"fold_request quotes captions without grain or prefix; ids stay on Run: and wake. Membership: this repository, not this clone; denylist: PR opened / checks passed / task archived. Keep prompt_text and how_to_text direct; AGENTS.md lockstep; do not factor MEMBERSHIP_PROBE.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"f3167b0d6e37b6f8","sum":"fold_request quotes captions without grain or prefix; ids stay on Run: and wake. nap-ack archived PR #70 in 0.10.0; fold-pack-captions archived PR #72.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"5324ef472b747f57","sum":"nap-ack archived PR #70 in 0.10.0; fold_request quotes captions without grain or prefix; ids stay on Run: and wake","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260828T203321Z-c2a6d088a4562375","text":"nap-ack archived to memory-bank/archive/enhancements/20260828-nap-ack.md; PR #70 shipped in 0.10.0","type":"note"},{"name":"20260828T204506Z-31f09329ef4334ce","text":"fold_request quotes pack captions without grain or prefix; ids stay on Run: and on wake","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"615d4dde9f0c32a6","sum":"fold-pack-captions: QA PASS (captions-only pack quotes; Run ids, wake grammar, dated leaf quotes, blank missing captions); archived to memory-bank/archive/enhancements/20260828-fold-pack-captions.md; PR #72 shipped","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260828T204631Z-e522d85fd7832cb5","text":"QA PASS fold-pack-captions: captions-only pack quotes; Run ids, wake grammar, dated leaf quotes, and blank missing captions verified.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260828T221517Z-3d32badb9e14e803","text":"fold-pack-captions archived to memory-bank/archive/enhancements/20260828-fold-pack-captions.md; PR #72 shipped","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"875be840dc360726","sum":"Membership: work on this repository, not this clone; how-to denylist is PR opened / checks passed / task archived. Keep the short phrase direct in prompt_text and how_to_text; AGENTS.md lockstep; factoring MEMBERSHIP_PROBE is not worth it.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"6d3d53d6fdf41b4e","sum":"Membership: another contributor needs it to work on this repository, not in this clone; how-to denylist is PR opened / checks passed / task archived.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260828T224532Z-bccf1887bea608d5","text":"note membership probe is work in this clone; how-to denylist is PR opened / checks passed / task archived","type":"note"},{"name":"20260829T000716Z-4f13dab49598cbb6","text":"Membership wording: say 'work on this repository', not 'work in this clone'; contributors have separate checkouts.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"24fb43f4be5c6f63","sum":"prompt_text and how_to_text keep the short membership phrase direct; AGENTS.md lockstep covers the bootstrap copy. Factoring MEMBERSHIP_PROBE harms readability for negligible benefit.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260829T001244Z-53dde24650751d3f","text":"prompt_text and how_to_text share MEMBERSHIP_PROBE; AGENTS.md lockstep covers the bootstrap copy.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260829T002301Z-2fe1954978d4b4e4","text":"Keep the short membership phrase direct in prompt_text and how_to_text; factoring it harms readability for negligible benefit.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"99582cfe7bce97c1","sum":"Write rule lives only in editable init/AGENTS.md; wake Usage is mechanics, owns its argv, and fold_request prints the exact Run: line. Prompt wording is unpinned except AGENTS.md lockstep. Leaf identity is leafset_id and leaf_digests; heal may drop a packed loose note (#77).","tree":{"c":[{"id":"6cee800557d99eac","sum":"Write rule lives only in init/AGENTS.md as editable policy; wake Usage is mechanics only. Usage owns every argv it claims; fold_request prints the exact Run: line. Prompt and write-rule wording are not pinned, only AGENTS.md lockstep and init identity; prefix teaches no argv.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"44e244aef3c74c04","sum":"Write rule lives only in init/AGENTS.md as editable policy; wake Usage is mechanics only (repeating membership would override a consumer's gate). Usage owns every argv it claims; fold_request prints the exact Run: line; Usage must not say Run:.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260829T164055Z-10a43354ce0f7523","text":"Creative: write rule lives only in init/AGENTS.md as editable policy; wake Usage is mechanics only; repeating membership on wake would override a consumer's gate.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260829T170414Z-a3069e4d545d0246","text":"Usage owns every argv it claims: note, nap ID-A ID-B CAPTION, recall, zoom, wake --path. fold_request still prints the exact Run: line; Usage must not say Run:","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"750292c631261ac3","sum":"prompt_text and write-rule wording are not pinned; only AGENTS.md prefix lockstep and init identity are. Prefix must not teach note/nap argv or Usage recipes; fold_request prints the exact Run: line; invoked as {AGENT_BIN} is not a recipe.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260829T204616Z-0c23f7c61b19009e","text":"prompt_text wording is not pinned; only AGENTS.md prefix lockstep and init identity. Prefix must not teach note/nap argv or Usage recipes.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260829T210418Z-1a2dc36f0829c667","text":"Usage does not teach nap argv; fold_request still prints the exact Run: line. Prefix may say invoked as {AGENT_BIN}; that is not a recipe. Write-rule wording is not pinned — AGENTS.md lockstep and init identity are.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"4d7aff95d7826e88","sum":"Leaf identity is content: leafset_id keys the multiset, leaf_digests the set. Heal dropping a packed-text loose note is the #77 shoebox, intended. Theory names the system; the leak may name those two functions.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"921a29be1c45a6be","sum":"Leaf identity is content: leafset_id keys the multiset, leaf_digests the set. Heal dropping a packed-text loose note is the #77 shoebox. Theory names the system; the leak may name those two functions. Do not cite notes.md for that judgement.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260829T211122Z-ad3d3bf48d2c3470","text":"Leaf identity is content-only: heal drops a loose note whose text already sits inside a pack, silently deleting a just-written note (#77). leafset_id keys on the multiset; leaf_digests keys on the set.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260829T214451Z-1d8350664f6c3f7d","text":"theory.md argues why it converges: name the system, not summem:line. Architecture owns filenames and functions. Exception: the #77 leak names leafset_id vs leaf_digests because that disagreement is the defect. Do not cite notes.md from 'leaving the cut open is a judgement'.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"20725fd9d9689622","sum":"Leaf identity is content (L is a set of facts), not per-file name+bytes; heal dropping a packed-text loose note is the #77 shoebox, intended, not a bug.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260829T220028Z-01040c6fdd23aa89","text":"Leaf identity is per-file (name + bytes); two recordings of one sentence are two leaves (#77)","type":"note"},{"name":"20260829T220314Z-0fd6a303482b711a","text":"L is a set of facts (content); heal dropping a packed-text loose note is the shoebox, not a bug. #77 trigger 1 is intended.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"a3a1b9be97f9acf5","sum":"No intersecting digests; same-text heals to later file #77. fold_request: text only; ids on Run:. CRLF as LF. flock naps/, else runtime-dir; msvcrt 30s. No os.name=nt. python .summem/summem wake. Win AGENTS.md: Unix, unadvertised. N: ./path note+1, nap leaves once. Saved. is ACK.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"8879531bae2973c5","sum":"write_nap rejects intersecting digest sets; same-text loose notes heal to the later file (#77). fold_request quotes text only; grain/date on wake/recall/zoom; ids on Run:. -h documents --path. Windows: stock AGENTS.md stays Unix, unadvertised; Run: prints host invoke; CRLF->LF","tree":{"c":[{"id":"c0b91843eda5c237","sum":"write_nap rejects intersecting digest sets; identical loose notes heal to the later filename (#77). fold_request quotes caption/note text only; grain and date stay on wake, recall, zoom; ids stay on Run:. No nested stores: root wake omits catalog how-to; -h documents --path.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"edb0ea0fb012e074","sum":"write_nap rejects intersecting digest sets; identical loose notes heal to the later filename (#77)","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260829T223329Z-dff4d96e7ee27dcc","text":"write_nap rejects any intersecting digest sets; two identical loose notes collapse on heal to the later filename (#77)","type":"note"},{"name":"20260829T230843Z-3ad41bcf17625899","text":"heal-same-text archived to memory-bank/archive/bug-fixes/20260829-heal-same-text.md; PR #79","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"ec999124e9bbfbf6","sum":"fold_request quotes caption/note text only; grain and date stay on wake, recall, and zoom; ids stay on Run:. With no nested stores, root wake omits catalog how-to; -h still documents --path.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260829T232955Z-ce112a8dc2e0252b","text":"fold_request quotes caption/note text only; grain and date stay on wake, recall, zoom; ids stay on Run:","type":"note"},{"name":"20260903T213935Z-aa0196fbeb246257","text":"Root wake omits catalog how-to when no nested stores exist; operator -h still documents --path.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"34adeab4ac984330","sum":"Windows: AGENTS.md clone-portable, stock stays Unix; do not advertise native support (no argv0 runs in both cmd.exe and Unix). Usage/Run: print host invoke (sys.executable). Lock and CRLF-on-read let a shop patch its bootstrap; no consumer .gitattributes, no store lock file.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"819660f9289867d7","sum":"Windows: AGENTS.md clone-portable (no C:\\ argv0; not pasteable). Usage/Run may print host invoke. note/nap crash on import fcntl; pathlib --path and python .summem/summem work; no store lock file. No consumer .gitattributes; canonicalize CRLF on read; punt this-repo git symlink.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260910T005128Z-e234bb60ff9049ba","text":"Windows: AGENTS.md stays clone-portable (no C:\\ argv0); Usage/Run: may print host invoke. note/nap crash on import fcntl; pathlib --path and python .summem/summem work; do not flock a store lock file.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260910T010940Z-0a0daf8323fd00b0","text":"Windows port: no consumer .gitattributes — canonicalize CRLF on read for digest/JSON; punt this-repo git symlink; AGENTS.md is not a pasteable argv0.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"597efaa40d5ae61b","sum":"Windows: do not advertise native support (no argv0 runs in both cmd.exe and Unix shells); internals (lock, CRLF) let a Windows shop patch its bootstrap. Usage/Run: print the host invoke (sys.executable); stock AGENTS.md stays Unix.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260910T011527Z-a89670306f0346b1","text":"Do not advertise native Windows: no argv0 is a command in both cmd.exe and a Unix shell. Ceiling is internals (lock, CRLF) so a Windows-only shop can patch their bootstrap.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260910T011559Z-5a487f135c8e6892","text":"Windows: print host-specific invoke on Usage/Run: (sys.executable). Stock AGENTS.md stays Unix; only a shop that patched the bootstrap will see the Windows lines.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"c1b15455613b38c1","sum":"CRLF as LF on read. Lock: flock naps/, else runtime-dir; msvcrt 30s, slack 1e-9. Never monkeypatch os.name to nt. python .summem/summem wake; names no path. Usage bare Unix, python Windows. N: ./path (note +1, nap leaves once). --path walks up. Nap line sequences; Saved. is ACK.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"5c6784a8f49cfad6","sum":"Windows: CRLF canonicalized on read; lock is naps/ flock else runtime-dir file, msvcrt wait 30s monotonic (test allows 1e-9 slack). Bootstrap wake is python .summem/summem wake; Usage bare on Unix, python-prefixed on Windows. Never monkeypatch os.name to nt on Linux.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"278f6b06c3a7df2f","sum":"Windows: CRLF canonicalized on read; lock is naps/ flock, else a runtime-dir file (fcntl then msvcrt); msvcrt wait is 30s monotonic elapsed, waited += 0.01 is backoff only. Do not monkeypatch os.name to nt on Linux (WindowsPath crash).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260910T014746Z-2240e9a38cbd40b5","text":"Windows: CRLF canonicalize on read; lock is naps/ flock else runtime-dir file (fcntl then msvcrt); do not monkeypatch os.name to nt on Linux (pathlib WindowsPath crash).","type":"note"},{"name":"20260910T153140Z-a4f303a1f756c0ca","text":"msvcrt lock wait is 30s monotonic elapsed; waited += 0.01 is backoff only, not the deadline","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"2bc6b5f9386d965f","sum":"Bootstrap wake is python .summem/summem wake; Usage is bare on Unix, python-prefixed on Windows. msvcrt lock-deadline test allows 1e-9 slack on sum(sleeps): 3.12+ can land at 30.000000000000007.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260910T234518Z-6ee83d5cd5f8d318","text":"Bootstrap wake is python .summem/summem wake; Usage is bare on Unix, python-prefixed on Windows","type":"note"},{"name":"20260910T234852Z-a4967a2ed0a2a1f1","text":"msvcrt lock-deadline test must allow 1e-9 slack on sum(sleeps); 3.12+ can land at 30.000000000000007","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"2dfeefe80535b269","sum":"First wake is python .summem/summem wake; the intro names no invoked-as path. Catalog lines are N: ./path, N a count from one ls-files pass (loose note +1, nap stem its leaves once). --path walks up to the nearest store. Usage nap line is sequencing only; Saved. owns the ACK.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"8a207191a07b0eec","sum":"First wake is python .summem/summem wake; the prompt intro names no invoked-as path. Root catalog lines are N: ./path, N the filename leaf grain from one ls-files pass (loose note +1, nap stem once).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260911T001036Z-0b56b4cb6829c2f7","text":"prompt_text intro is managed through SumMem only; first-wake is python .summem/summem wake; no invoked-as path","type":"note"},{"name":"20260915T225419Z-4b8f0ca4ed1bdaaf","text":"Root catalog lines are N: ./path; N is filename leaf grain from the same ls-files pass (loose note +1, nap stem once). Path is the ./ token.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"784324e867a813e8","sum":"Catalog N: is a count; --path on note, nap, recall, zoom walks up to the nearest store. Usage nap line is sequencing only; Saved. owns the ACK (no already-stored or do-not-retry).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260915T230226Z-c1e5723514aa52a8","text":"Catalog how-to: N: is a count; note --path <file> walks up to the nearest store. Same --path on nap, recall, zoom.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260915T230920Z-fd73dce7353c1e73","text":"Usage nap line is sequencing only; Saved. owns ACK (no already-stored / do-not-retry).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
